Package: PhysioTrial
Type: Package
Title: Randomization, Allocation Concealment and Blinding for Clinical Trials
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: person("Yusuke", "Matsui", email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com", role = c("aut","cre"))
Description: Provides reproducible trial-design infrastructure for simple,
    permuted-block, stratified-block, and Pocock-Simon minimization
    randomization. Sealed allocation sequences, deterministic audit
    fingerprints, treatment-code management, append-only unblinding logs,
    CONSORT/SPIRIT operations, adverse-event summaries, explicit analysis
    populations, missing-data hooks, and endpoint-analysis wrappers support
    auditable clinical-trial workflows. Deterministic CDISC SDTM-shaped and
    ADaM-shaped exports provide linked tabulation and analysis datasets without
    claiming external regulatory conformance.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    digest,
    methods,
    PhysioCore (>= 0.3.0),
    stats
Suggests:
    DiagrammeR,
    PhysioClinical,
    PhysioClinStats,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0)
